[{"page_id":"63e19b096357436c8e94f3d267004c35","title":"Dump","teamspace_id":"af339680-2a72-4fc5-93db-32bd941218b5","contentMaxLength":7500,"text":""},{"page_id":"cae59116070e49f1aa1c24544393edee","title":"Books","teamspace_id":"af339680-2a72-4fc5-93db-32bd941218b5","text":""},{"page_id":"b192c34655774448b57be6a9012500ca","title":"Business","teamspace_id":"af339680-2a72-4fc5-93db-32bd941218b5","text":""},{"page_id":"2c61bdd16b9242588c2da411d7a88888","title":"Food","teamspace_id":"af339680-2a72-4fc5-93db-32bd941218b5","text":""},{"page_id":"00f7483148084dd7a33df5315035f61f","title":"Dating","teamspace_id":"af339680-2a72-4fc5-93db-32bd941218b5","text":""},{"page_id":"3096ff899a0c45d795852a80aec4d91e","title":"Misc","teamspace_id":"af339680-2a72-4fc5-93db-32bd941218b5","text":""},{"page_id":"7226d8094d0f45f684d959c10e1fbf3b","title":"Dump","teamspace_id":"134849a8-d323-4b8f-8f91-ce22ccf5b337","contentMaxLength":7500,"text":"Here is the result of \"view\" for the Page with URL {{https://www.notion.so/7226d8094d0f45f684d959c10e1fbf3b}} as of 2026-02-13T02:13:53.448Z:\n<page url=\"{{https://www.notion.so/7226d8094d0f45f684d959c10e1fbf3b}}\">\n<ancestor-path></ancestor-path>\n<properties>\n{\"title\":\"Dump\"}\n</properties>\n<content>\n<empty-block/>\n**Give out free business ideas**\nMake it a culture.\nHop on trends of famous people and solve a micro problem that relates to the trend - You already have proof of concept.\nGiveaways for the best idea shared\nIf you like someone’s idea in the comments, DM them! Get to know them\nI want to know if anyone has connected in the comments\n<empty-block/>\nLive data log of daily movements & tasks\n<empty-block/>\nNooks AI \n<empty-block/>\nContent ideas:\n- What happened to_____\n- E.g. Call to leap, Danny Devan, *thisisnotlegaladvice*\n- **An ordinary individual that became an empowered product leader **\n---\n[https://about.gitlab.com/why-gitlab/]({{https://about.gitlab.com/why-gitlab/}})\n<empty-block/>\n<empty-block/>\n**Prod-Ops**\nA role in an operations based startup who is promoted to RnD who has a deep understanding of operations in the ground.\n<empty-block/>\n<empty-block/>\n<empty-block/>\nLegal for everything: Lawpath \nM\n<empty-block/>\nWhenever someone gives business advice, it is based on a skill or quality they lacked at some point, but overcame. \n<empty-block/>\n<empty-block/>\nCool company domain: portfole.io\n<empty-block/>\n<empty-block/>\n[Plausible Analytics]({{https://plausible.io/}})\n- website analytics \n<empty-block/>\n<empty-block/>\nSkool.com\n- Skool Games\n<empty-block/>\nWhitelisting marketing? Use someone else’s audience? \n<empty-block/>\n<empty-block/>\n<empty-block/>\n<empty-block/>\nBen Personal branding: \n<empty-block/>\n- Content repurposing for different platforms:\n<empty-block/>\nplatforms: \n<empty-block/>\n- Tik Tok \n- Youtube\n<empty-block/>\nShorts:\nLongs:\n<empty-block/>\n<empty-block/>\nTools to use \n- capcut\n- opusclip \n- Screenstudio\n<empty-block/>\n<empty-block/>\nedits:\n- text on screen (text underneath chin)\n- Cutting to B-roll\n<empty-block/>\n<empty-block/>\nFuture edits:\n- animations \n- thumbnails (photoshop)\n<empty-block/>\nbold white text:\n- matt grat inspiration \n<empty-block/>\nmonday:\n-\n<empty-block/>\n<empty-block/>\n<empty-block/>\n<empty-block/>\nfutture\n1. 1 long form\n2. podcast (shortform clip)\n<empty-block/>\n<empty-block/>\nExport settings:\n- upload instagram: 1080p \n<empty-block/>\n<empty-block/>\nlong export: 4k\nShort export 1080p\n<empty-block/>\nCapcut login:\n<empty-block/>\nuser: hayden@corewavesolutions.com\nCounter1Lift!\n<empty-block/>\nopus login: Soon \n<empty-block/>\n<empty-block/>\n<empty-block/>\n<page url=\"{{https://www.notion.so/fc42ad9b568c4107bca9be2db90a746d}}\">Products that are substantially better than their predecessors </page>\n<page url=\"{{https://www.notion.so/128348f4363480d6a44af23dc90fc7f6}}\">Startup Litmus Test </page>\n<empty-block/>\n<empty-block/>\n[https://www.dewr.gov.au/self-employment-assistance]({{https://www.dewr.gov.au/self-employment-assistance}})\n<empty-block/>\n<empty-block/>\n<empty-block/>\nCorize notes:\n<empty-block/>\n- bio edit button not editable without clicking ‘edit’. Extra step not needed\n- “may”?\n- Not able to add more subjects I teach after the the input value is not empty\n\t- same with type of teaching  - a problem if I increase my skillset and teach more skills\n- email notifications font too big \n<empty-block/>\nmy_study\n- home page and my study go to the same place in group focus\n<empty-block/>\nsearch\n- UI needs to be more clean\n- across the page versus down \n-\n-\n<empty-block/>\nCourse:\n- information prioritisation could be reconsidered\n-  took me a long time to find this CTA\n- Offer could be smaller and easier to read \n\t![](https://prod-files-secure.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/f517d51c-d559-4a6e-a307-29e438b5b332/89083723-0ce7-4a4e-b449-9b7c1624d596/Screen_Shot_2024-12-20_at_2.34.19_pm.png?X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&X-Amz-Content-Sha256=UNSIGNED-PAYLOAD&X-Amz-Credential=ASIAZI2LB4666F2FQNX3%2F20260223%2Fus-west-2%2Fs3%2Faws4_request&X-Amz-Date=20260223T085030Z&X-Amz-Expires=3600&X-Amz-Security-Token=IQoJb3JpZ2luX2VjEBEaCXVzLXdlc3QtMiJHMEUCIQDmrL7OdVI5NkcULlyjWeeyjikuyVOda2YTuwSRy5IMoQIgWS7qpc%2FWhB%2BFh%2BSQzazQUkJLOogXyBqmE4%2Fc0%2FdPhs0qiAQI2v%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2FARAAGgw2Mzc0MjMxODM4MDUiDEwu1G6vdJul9XFo6SrcA%2FXQnslwFwZevobODrtY7h%2B0CoLXOAxyLQSB%2FPtcTjfwBl%2B%2BFPQOc1VcY9uHAE6u%2FFEB65eebo9j1cL9k1DPW9cyGVut%2Bd4qYoyu2GNoIeVi57U9uFrUcyObhgWmsFBy%2Fnvqq0uTRyYg0fObAHsk4NoMjXcVPfyhCtjREWWxnkNOdr51Om%2FTHY0czNRNbNZOU3DWsg6tSd04poGdQiLiGVQyqpSBfJqjiZHNGO0Wvkq27LBP22LVu19c1TfVhUERpqU2wRv%2F47B2guMEK3xYbcfO67POCQPiwD4bP7T90YVYwk9xbIsWc5A%2F%2BB5uOzb5uxcFoEReFC2438QBjrMuRXMFTKzwz1c6CaqLHv3zSS2%2B8dgI13io1dnOdnC2LPDblZLpe78J5VWG4hDw3t7eFEqlAcQmqGNdyyHpUGtvIv7bV4EFjZ0ERA3wDOvS9zpKeYacPPTaBiTE8Uv4dhlLIyDTnUCS5zUligh808J4UNR%2Bpg%2F6LqXfDkAK2lK5CGDrXUi2OZz5j5O1%2F0Ae7PvGHOs